  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The political landscape in Uttar Pradesh is preparing for the 2027 Assembly elections as opposition parties navigate alliance strategies. Representatives from the Congress party have expressed an intent to partner with the Samajwadi Party, emphasizing the need for a balanced and respectable seat-sharing framework. In response to these developments, the Samajwadi Party has organized a dedicated four-member panel to facilitate these discussions, which are expected to commence in the coming days. The focus of these negotiations remains centered on candidate winnability to effectively challenge the governing Bharatiya Janata Party. While these talks are in early stages, the coalition effort has drawn scrutiny from other political figures, such as Chandrashekhar Aazad, who has questioned the dedication of both parties in their shared goal of defeating the current administration.",
